{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  HOLIDAY SALES BAR  (auto-recurring, calendar baked into code)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Full calendar lives in the "sched" block below - works the moment the section
  is added, NO blocks needed. Frames match on MONTH + DAY, so every window
  repeats automatically each year.

  Two behaviors:
    - COUNTDOWN -> ROLLOVER (flash_from set): the sale is LIVE and counts down
      to the END of the flash_from day (e.g. "sale ends July 4th"). After that
      day it ROLLS OVER into a rolling 2-hour flash for the trailing days
      (e.g. Jul 1-4 counts down, then Jul 5-6 flash).
    - ALWAYS FLASH (flash_from empty): live sale, rolling 2h flash the whole
      window (seasonal fillers, Black Friday, etc.).

  Record: start | end | priority | flash_from | bg | text | accent | line1 | line2
    - start/end/flash_from : MM-DD (year ignored). start > end wraps the year.
    - flash_from : LAST day of the countdown (deadline). Flash rolls over AFTER it.

  Flash length + the DAYS->seconds switch are in section settings.
  "Always show seconds" (Flash timer settings) forces HRS:MIN:SEC on every frame.
  TIMEZONE: day flips at midnight in your shop timezone. EASTER moves yearly.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

